                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;In sprint-1 branch all the GridGain references in XML files names under the &quot;docs&quot; folder, as well as the content were changed to Ignite.&lt;/li&gt;
